"""Generate a reviewable report from observed results, never from pipeline intent."""
import hashlib,json
from pathlib import Path
ROOT=Path('/root/gpufree-data/tw_stage1/issue17_20261113')
def read(n):return json.loads((ROOT/n).read_text())
def fmt(v):return 'NA' if v is None else f'{v:.6g}' if isinstance(v,(int,float)) else str(v)
def main():
 for n in ['statistics_complete','automatic_media_complete','figures_complete']:assert (ROOT/n).exists(),n
 assert read('formal_training_audit.json')['passed'];manual=read('manual_review.json');assert manual['actual_review_completed']
 a=read('acceptance.json');p=read('paired_comparisons.json');s=read('seed_statistics.json');g=read('group_statistics.json');selection=read('representative_selection.json');raw=read('raw_analysis_audit.json')
 verdict='All frozen gates pass' if a['all_gates_pass'] else 'Not accepted: one or more frozen gates fail'
 lines=['# Issue17: integer gait clock and mirrored half-cycle augmentation','',verdict+'. Primary pass: '+str(a['primary_pass'])+'.','',
 'This study follows issue17 and decision comment6831246933. Both new groups use the integer20-step clock; control_int has no augmentation and sym_int adds spatial reflection plus a half-cycle phase shift with mirror loss disabled. Original control6000 is reused only as a secondary descriptive reference. The primary comparison is sym_int minus control_int. No checkpoint scan, phase retuning or extra formal updates are permitted.','',
 '## Design and preflight','',
 'The initial unchanged-floating-clock proposal failed strict reward invariance at phase boundaries. This was reported before training, then the owner authorized the integer clock and a new matched control. Original evidence and both protocol versions are retained. Period0.4s,step0.02s,offsets[0,0.5],threshold0.55 and reward weights stay unchanged. Integer indices give11stance steps per leg in every20-step cycle, with double support exactly at indices0and10. Old CPU floating-clock replay shows40% asymmetric cycles among50; this is a synthetic numerical diagnostic, not an observed training failure rate.','',
 'Tests execute all1000integer steps and every contact pattern: both actual reward functions are elementwise invariant after LRswap+10steps. Actor101/critic134/action30 involution, TensorDict ordering and RNG-neutral transforms pass. The original vs disabled entry points reproduce the actual4096-env two-update model/optimizer/RNG/physics states byte-for-byte. Enabled control/augmentation runtime preflights and all18active reward-term audits are preserved. See protocol_plan.md,protocol_amendment.json,reward_invariance_table.md,disabled_two_update_reproduction.json and enabled_preflight_audit.json.','',
 '## Formal budget and verification','',
 'Five matched requested4500 parents and training seeds,4096environments and1500updates each for control_int and sym_int:10runs and15000formalupdates. Actor/critic/optimizer/std restored exactly; no std reset. Formal training audit verifies all ten final checkpoints, config differences and actual augmentation calls. Each rollout has98304samples; minibatches are24576without augmentation and49152with augmentation. All30000augmented minibatch calls per treatment run are checked.','',
 f"All90formal evaluation jobs completed: {raw['command_records']} command records,{raw['initial_trial_rows']} initial trials,{raw['all_trial_heading_arrays']} full all-trial heading arrays independently reconstructed. Clean original and pure-spatial mirror each have six commands; bounded combined has three forward commands. Each uses1024env x3eval seeds x20s. Clean six-command and combined three-command reset ordinals preserve their respective original protocols.",'',
 'The training transform NEGATES gait sin/cos; pure-spatial evaluation reflection leaves them unchanged. These interventions must not be conflated. Training seeds are the five paired sample units, averaging three evaluation seeds within each; bootstrap95 intervals are unadjusted. No missing seed endpoint is dropped. Reset-aware heading is the sum of wrapped consecutive quaternion-yaw increments excluding reset/terminal frames, then absolute-valued per trial. Full20s endpoints are conditional on survival; prefixes, failure counts and exposure remain separate.','',
 '## Primary and every frozen guard','', '|Gate|Pass|','|---|---|']
 durations=read('training_records.json');assert len(durations)==10
 budget_lines=['## Actual training durations','','|Group|Training seed|Updates|Wall seconds|','|---|---:|---:|---:|']
 for run in durations:budget_lines.append('|'+run['group']+'|'+str(run['training_seed'])+'|'+str(run['updates'])+'|'+fmt(run['wall_seconds'])+'|')
 cleanup=read('unused_intermediate_weight_cleanup_receipt.json');assert cleanup['completed'] and cleanup['all_ten_final_checkpoints_sha256_preserved'] and cleanup['all_frozen_training_and_evaluation_sources_preserved']
 budget_lines+=['',f"After all training finished, the user authorized removal of unused training weights. Only {cleanup['deleted_count']} unreferenced intermediate checkpoints from these ten completed runs were deleted ({cleanup['deleted_bytes']} bytes). All ten final model/optimizer checkpoints, original parents, historical runs and frozen inputs were preserved and hash-verified. No checkpoint selection or extra updates occurred. Exact deleted paths and SHA256 values remain in [cleanup receipt](unused_intermediate_weight_cleanup_receipt.json) and [inventory](unused_intermediate_weight_inventory.json).",'']
 index=lines.index('## Primary and every frozen guard');lines[index:index]=budget_lines
 for k,v in a['gates'].items():lines.append('|'+k+'|'+str(v)+'|')
 lines+=['','Primary paired difference (degrees):','', '```json',json.dumps(p['primary'],indent=2),'```','',
 'Full paired diagnostics (including all O+M, E, relative tracking and fall intervals):','', '```json',json.dumps(p,indent=2),'```','',
 '## Per-training-seed metrics and denominators','', '|Protocol/group/command|Seed|Mean abs20s deg|Signed20s deg|Survivors/initialN|Fall rate|Prefix seconds|Mean forward speed|','|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|']
 for key,rows in s.items():
  for seed,r in rows.items():lines.append('|'+ '|'.join([key,seed,fmt(r['full20s_survivor_heading_mean_abs_degrees']),fmt(r['full20s_survivor_heading_signed_mean_degrees']),str(r['full20s_survivors_total_3evals'])+'/'+str(r['initial_trials_total_3evals']),fmt(r['fall_rate']),fmt(r['initial_prefix_mean_duration_s']),fmt(r['full_vx_mean'])])+'|')
 lines+=['','All group estimates and training-seed95 bounds remain in group_statistics.json; all450jobstatistics and460800initial-trial rows remain in job_statistics.json and per_trial_heading.csv.gz. No NA is treated as a passed gate.','',
 '## Secondary old-control comparison','', 'control_int minus old control6000 is descriptive only and does not determine acceptance.','', '```json',json.dumps(read('old_control_secondary.json'),indent=2),'```','',
 '## Fixed-state action equivariance','',
 'All fifteen baseline/new models use the SAME102400raw post-step actor states: five old-control seeds,1024env at20prespecified forward0.5 time points. No survival/error filtering. Source rollouts reproduce all prior recorded metrics and arrays exactly. E is per-state L2(pi(s)-Ma*pi(Ms(s)))/max(L2(pi(s)),1e-8), using the TRAINING half-cycle reflection and deterministic CPU inference. Mean/median/p95, small-denominator count and per-source-seed results are retained in equivariance_statistics.json. This fixed empirical state-set statistic is not a fresh rollout acceptance test.','',
 '## New-group representative media','',
 f"All {selection['candidate_count']} initial sym_int forward0.5 trials enter selection; no survival filter. Scope={selection['selection_scope']}; censored trials={selection['censored_initial_trials']}. Median absolute selection drift={selection['group_median_absolute_heading_degrees']:.6f}deg; selected={selection['heading_abs_degrees']:.6f}deg, trainseed{selection['training_seed']},evalseed{selection['eval_seed']},env{selection['env_id']}. If any trial is censored, the selection consistently uses initial-prefix drift for every trial and reports exposure; it does not invent a full20s endpoint.",'',
 'Exact source reconstruction reproduces recorded metrics and all saved arrays before replay. Videos set saved poses without integrating dynamics; colored USD original attributes and source digests are verified. Front camera follows translation/heading; overhead follows translation with fixed world heading. Both include worldXYtrail, heading, reset annotations and the selection/censoring label.','',
 '[Colored front20s](videos/sym_int_front.mp4) | [Colored overhead20s](videos/sym_int_overhead.mp4) | [Joint color legend](joint_colors.json) | [Video QA](video_quality_audit.json)','',
 '## Figures','']
 for n in ['heading_acceptance','original_mirrored_heading','paired_primary_and_symmetry','tracking_and_fall_guards','fixed_state_action_equivariance','integer_clock_diagnosis']:lines+=['!['+n+'](figures/'+n+'.png)','']
 lines+=['## Interpretation and next action','',read('scientific_conclusion.json')['summary'],'']+['- '+x for x in read('scientific_conclusion.json')['limitations']]
 lines+=['','Next action: '+read('scientific_conclusion.json')['next_recommendation'],'','All models/data/media remain remote. Frozen training/evaluation digests, runtime audits, exact original-state reproduction, raw-data reconstruction, actual manual-review file digests and final lossless Git archive manifest bind the evidence. Failed prior hypotheses and the separate stopped SuperMimic line remain distinct.','']
 (ROOT/'results.md').write_text('\n'.join(lines));(ROOT/'report_outputs_sha256.json').write_text(json.dumps(dict(source_sha256=hashlib.sha256(Path(__file__).read_bytes()).hexdigest(),inputs={n:hashlib.sha256((ROOT/n).read_bytes()).hexdigest() for n in ['training_records.json','unused_intermediate_weight_inventory.json','unused_intermediate_weight_cleanup_receipt.json','fixed_state_set_audit.json','protocol_plan.md','protocol_amendment.json','formal_training_audit.json','raw_analysis_audit.json','seed_statistics.json','group_statistics.json','paired_comparisons.json','acceptance.json','old_control_secondary.json','fixed_state_set.json','equivariance_statistics.json','representative_selection.json','reconstruction_state.json','video_plan.json','video_quality_audit.json','manual_review.json','figure_outputs_sha256.json','scientific_conclusion.json']},report_sha256=hashlib.sha256((ROOT/'results.md').read_bytes()).hexdigest()),indent=2)+'\n');print('ISSUE17_REPORT_WRITTEN',flush=True)
if __name__=='__main__':main()
